Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.14,0:00:15.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I've obtained one disc. I have it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.06,0:00:17.47,Default,,0,0,0,,He'll come back to life.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.82,0:00:20.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I am certain that my father\Nwill definitely regenerate.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.88,0:00:24.42,Default,,0,0,0,,How about we call this\NOperation Savage Guardian?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.90,0:00:26.61,Default,,0,0,0,,You oughta let him tag along.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.80,0:00:27.88,Default,,0,0,0,,He'll be a great help.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.96,0:00:31.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I forgot to mention, his\Nname is Weather Forecast.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.14,0:00:34.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Jumpin' Jack Spark!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.88,0:00:36.38,Default,,0,0,0,,No weather forecast!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.72,0:00:46.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Still though, where is that\Nanti-gravity-wielding thief?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.14,0:00:47.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I need to get the disc back!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.28,0:01:08.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe you're a good girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.24,0:01:10.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure if you're in my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.86,0:01:12.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Please don't let you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.82,0:01:21.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll see you soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.44,0:01:23.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.35,0:01:24.18,Default,,0,0,0,,All right? All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.29,0:01:28.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Get away from!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.21,0:01:29.38,Default,,0,0,0,,No more time!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.46,0:01:30.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't wanna play?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.80,0:01:32.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Get more time!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.16,0:01:33.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.42,0:01:34.70,Default,,0,0,0,,1, 2, 3!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.78,0:01:36.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Come and find a way!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.22,0:01:37.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Fight for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.07,0:01:46.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Break out! We tell me, you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.60,0:02:25.22,Default,,0,0,0,,The abnormality alarm has\Nbeen activated in Hallway 7B.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.80,0:02:26.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.88,0:02:28.42,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Passage 7B.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.58,0:02:30.34,Default,,0,0,0,,We're currently confirming the situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.42,0:02:31.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Did something unusual happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.92,0:02:33.42,Default,,0,0,0,,We're not certain yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.76,0:02:37.76,Default,,0,0,0,,However, Passage 7B is only meant\Nfor going to and from the factory.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.98,0:02:41.12,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no possibility that\Nit's a fire or a prisoner riot.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.20,0:02:42.67,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no need to worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.86,0:02:44.26,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I'm not worried.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.66,0:02:48.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I maintain the utmost trust in the Green\NDolphin Street Prison and its prisoners.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.60,0:02:53.58,Default,,0,0,0,,It was really just quite noisy, so I\Ngot unnecessarily curious and inquired.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.04,0:02:56.84,Default,,0,0,0,,You do know that there hasn't\Nbeen even one successful
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.92,0:02:59.54,Default,,0,0,0,,escapee from the Aquarium\Nin the past 20 years,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.62,0:03:00.45,Default,,0,0,0,,correct?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.53,0:03:02.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Plus, outside the\Npassageway is the courtyard.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.98,0:03:06.39,Default,,0,0,0,,There won't be anyone trying\Nto escape from this location.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.78,0:03:08.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You're certainly right about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.74,0:03:09.68,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll handle it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.78,0:03:10.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Father.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.80,0:03:11.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.71,0:03:12.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Very well, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.70,0:03:21.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Another quick unnecessary question.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.86,0:03:24.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that clock hanging up\Nin the corner accurate?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.52,0:03:27.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, of course it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.42,0:03:29.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like it's 11.58.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.38,0:03:31.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess it's almost lunchtime.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.56,0:03:39.96,Default,,0,0,0,,At 11.51, there was an outgoing\Ncall to the Speedwagon Foundation.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.44,0:03:44.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got my usual ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.20,0:03:49.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to listen to this recording, play\Nthe audio of this one outgoing call.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.98,0:03:52.74,Default,,0,0,0,,From the women's prison\Nphone stand number 16.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.36,0:03:55.60,Default,,0,0,0,,The call from about seven minutes ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.52,0:03:57.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey weather forecast.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.60,0:04:03.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Since you made contact with me, you're\Nnow also controlled by zero gravity.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.18,0:04:10.46,Default,,0,0,0,,That weird guy isn't anywhere to be seen.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.54,0:04:12.50,Default,,0,0,0,,We need to get the disc back quickly!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.58,0:04:14.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't panic.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.46,0:04:17.94,Default,,0,0,0,,The thief has to be somewhere\Ninside this wash house.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.02,0:04:19.34,Default,,0,0,0,,He must be hiding.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.42,0:04:23.28,Default,,0,0,0,,The courtyard's on the\Nother side of that door.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.36,0:04:25.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Your objective lies just\Nbeyond that doorway.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.04,0:04:28.94,Default,,0,0,0,,However, the door appears to be locked.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.02,0:04:32.52,Default,,0,0,0,,You might need to blast it\Naway or force it open somehow.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.60,0:04:37.00,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a little bit of a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.40,0:04:40.70,Default,,0,0,0,,It's sort of hard to say it out loud.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.78,0:04:43.50,Default,,0,0,0,,The thing is it's a personal matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.58,0:04:46.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Although I am at a physical\Nlimit, so I'm troubled.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.52,0:04:51.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Um and I don't know why it\Nbecame a problem so suddenly.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.86,0:04:54.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh well but um
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.04,0:04:58.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I do think it happens to\Neveryone sometimes, hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.24,0:04:59.50,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.58,0:05:00.87,Default,,0,0,0,,It's like I was saying
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.48,0:05:04.02,Default,,0,0,0,,It's related to your lower\Nhalf begins with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.10,0:05:06.94,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a biological urge you have\Nwhen you're thinking to yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.02,0:05:07.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank God
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.12,0:05:10.04,Default,,0,0,0,,It isn't number two.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.12,0:05:11.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh Do you need to take a piss?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.96,0:05:13.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't leave me close to say that
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.50,0:05:15.85,Default,,0,0,0,,It's getting really bad
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.12,0:05:20.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You would have to do it\Nsomewhere over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.34,0:05:23.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh geez I never should have asked you know
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.00,0:05:25.00,Default,,0,0,0,,A man, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.32,0:05:26.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I already did it myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.38,0:05:29.20,Default,,0,0,0,,There, just now while floating.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.48,0:05:32.77,Default,,0,0,0,,When you find yourself in zero gravity,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.12,0:05:36.24,Default,,0,0,0,,the blood in your body will\Nsuddenly collect at your head.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.32,0:05:40.85,Default,,0,0,0,,That blood is usually down in the lower\Nparts of the body because of gravity.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.08,0:05:44.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Between your skin and bones is flesh\Nthat's squishy and swollen with blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.96,0:05:46.32,Default,,0,0,0,,It's called Moonface.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.14,0:05:49.97,Default,,0,0,0,,However,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.18,0:05:54.10,Default,,0,0,0,,it can be dangerous when too much\Nblood goes up into your head And thus,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.18,0:05:58.10,Default,,0,0,0,,your kidneys automatically begin working\Nto lessen the amount of blood in you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.18,0:06:00.77,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why there's a\Nsevere diuretic effect.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.98,0:06:05.46,Default,,0,0,0,,It removes sodium content through\Npiss and thins out the blood. Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.68,0:06:06.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Hang on a second!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.59,0:06:07.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.72,0:06:09.26,Default,,0,0,0,,My clouds will absorb it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.56,0:06:15.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! Hey! This...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.52,0:06:16.70,Default,,0,0,0,,This is floating!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.12,0:06:18.26,Default,,0,0,0,,What the heck is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.34,0:06:20.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is it spilling out from the clouds?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.34,0:06:33.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, look here, weather\Nforecast! My... my blood!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.20,0:06:36.36,Default,,0,0,0,,It's being sucked into the wall's seam!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.44,0:06:37.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Shit! Mine too.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.84,0:06:39.94,Default,,0,0,0,,It's coming out of my room from earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.02,0:06:41.58,Default,,0,0,0,,My nose won't stop bleeding either!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.66,0:06:43.42,Default,,0,0,0,,It's gushing! It's so...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.50,0:06:44.54,Default,,0,0,0,,so painful.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.10,0:06:45.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Slowly.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.24,0:06:47.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Could this be...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.74,0:06:48.70,Default,,0,0,0,,how I die?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.16,0:06:51.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolene!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.18,0:07:04.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything that I make contact\Nwith enters zero gravity.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.26,0:07:13.58,Default,,0,0,0,,That means this room itself\Nhas become zero gravity.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.26,0:07:16.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Air!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.17,0:07:18.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Air doesn't stay put\Nwithin a zero gravity zone!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.88,0:07:22.41,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll get pulled by the surrounding\Ngravity and then escape!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.06,0:07:25.10,Default,,0,0,0,,We need to fill these gaps in the wall,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.18,0:07:28.76,Default,,0,0,0,,or at this rate, we'll suffocate\Nif we don't seal them quickly!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.84,0:07:29.72,Default,,0,0,0,,No, Jolene.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.06,0:07:32.64,Default,,0,0,0,,What we really need to worry\Nabout is not suffocation,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.72,0:07:34.36,Default,,0,0,0,,but the fact that our\Nblood will boil and we
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.44,0:07:37.32,Default,,0,0,0,,will die from that before\Nwe even run out of air.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.54,0:07:41.48,Default,,0,0,0,,While within a vacuum, a person's\Nblood will boil right up like water.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.56,0:07:45.78,Default,,0,0,0,,A vacuum with zero gravity makes\None's blood dry up in 20 seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.12,0:07:50.00,Default,,0,0,0,,It's quite a long time before the\Nindividual would ever suffocate.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.84,0:08:03.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Reloading bullets.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.88,0:08:07.20,Default,,0,0,0,,We're gonna get shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.58,0:08:08.88,Default,,0,0,0,,So come on, Jolene.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.04,0:08:10.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's hide somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.50,0:08:11.66,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.74,0:08:13.64,Default,,0,0,0,,My nose is still bleeding way too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.72,0:08:15.25,Default,,0,0,0,,We gotta stop the airflow.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.60,0:08:16.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Weather forecast.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.28,0:08:48.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Take good care not to breathe too heavily.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.52,0:08:51.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I collected what little remaining\Nair was left within this
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.78,0:08:55.31,Default,,0,0,0,,room and covered our bodies\Nwith clouds in order to trap it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.20,0:08:59.20,Default,,0,0,0,,So this is a cloud suit?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.34,0:09:02.64,Default,,0,0,0,,This room is basically a vacuum now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.06,0:09:05.34,Default,,0,0,0,,These clouds hold all the oxygen left.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.14,0:09:08.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Your nose, it stopped bleeding.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.24,0:09:12.30,Default,,0,0,0,,So how long can we keep on breathing?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.84,0:09:15.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want to answer that question,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.54,0:09:17.31,Default,,0,0,0,,but probably like two minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.62,0:09:19.88,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a cloud suit on the verge of death.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.96,0:09:23.08,Default,,0,0,0,,We need to find and defeat\Nthat man during this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.16,0:09:26.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Otherwise, we'd be thrown into\Nthe vacuum for sure afterwards.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.90,0:09:28.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, that's correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.40,0:09:31.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, where is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.44,0:09:38.34,Default,,0,0,0,,We need to find him, because even if we\Ndon't do anything, he'll still attack us.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.22,0:09:40.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.34,0:09:43.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that I'm not bleeding,\Nsomething's been bothering me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.76,0:09:44.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, Jolene.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.72,0:09:47.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I said two minutes, but\Nit could only be one.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.08,0:09:49.44,Default,,0,0,0,,We need to hurry and focus on finding him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.52,0:09:51.46,Default,,0,0,0,,The carbon dioxide is increasing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.54,0:09:55.28,Default,,0,0,0,,But the laundry hamper, why\Nisn't that floating as well?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.92,0:09:57.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You see that hamper over there?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.14,0:10:02.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I've touched the floor, walls, doors,\Nand even shutters of this room.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.16,0:10:04.86,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why the whole chamber\Nentered into zero gravity.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.94,0:10:06.76,Default,,0,0,0,,and now everything is floating.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.20,0:10:10.84,Default,,0,0,0,,But then, why are the hamper and\Nthose metal barrels not floating too?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.92,0:10:13.16,Default,,0,0,0,,They're attached to the floor instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.16,0:10:19.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Also, our strange foe: how is the enemy\Npossibly breathing inside of this?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.78,0:10:24.37,Default,,0,0,0,,vacuum Given the circumstances shouldn't\Nthe blood of that freak be boiling up
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.94,0:10:33.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I see that's his attack\Nrange. Distance his
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.40,0:10:36.46,Default,,0,0,0,,zero gravity's got a distance range and it
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.54,0:10:38.90,Default,,0,0,0,,doesn't Extend through\Nthe whole room attack
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.98,0:10:42.06,Default,,0,0,0,,distance the laundry\Nhamper has got to be within
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.68,0:10:44.68,Default,,0,0,0,,20 meters from where we're floating.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.76,0:10:46.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Zero gravity ends there.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.30,0:10:49.86,Default,,0,0,0,,If we go that way, there will\Nsurely be normal air to breathe.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.94,0:10:52.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You gotta go first, Weather Forecast.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.48,0:10:53.94,Default,,0,0,0,,He's outside the vacuum.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.24,0:10:56.92,Default,,0,0,0,,If you don't get a supply\Nof oxygen before I do,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.00,0:10:59.82,Default,,0,0,0,,there's no way either one\Nof us can approach him.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.90,0:11:01.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm inclined to agree.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.34,0:11:03.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Outside the hamper.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.86,0:11:11.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Go now, Weather Forecast.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.06,0:11:15.46,Default,,0,0,0,,The pressure within the cloud\Nsuit is becoming strange you've
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.54,0:11:18.95,Default,,0,0,0,,got to go right now quit before\Nthe cloud suit flies away.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.42,0:11:38.52,Default,,0,0,0,,No way in hell you can\Nget out of my attack
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.60,0:11:40.74,Default,,0,0,0,,range you fools he'll\Ntry to shoot him down.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.82,0:11:42.68,Default,,0,0,0,,But I won't let him!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.58,0:11:46.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll do all I can to\Nguard weather forecast!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.56,0:11:56.36,Default,,0,0,0,,That guy's coming around us.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.56,0:11:57.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna charge!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.34,0:12:25.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.16,0:12:35.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Weather forecast is going to\Nreach the oxygen in a few feet.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.60,0:12:39.90,Default,,0,0,0,,As soon as my ally gets to that supply\Nof fresh air, he's going to corner you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.98,0:12:43.00,Default,,0,0,0,,If you want it that\Nbadly, then have some air.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.40,0:12:46.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't even have to\Ngo to the laundry hamper.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.58,0:12:51.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Just a moment ago, I finished my\Nattack and hit my true target.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.74,0:12:57.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I was not attempting to direct the bullets\Nto hit the man you call weather forecast.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.54,0:13:00.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I meant to hit that metal\Nbarrel to damage it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.16,0:13:06.36,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a little bit of air\Nin the metal barrel, correct?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.44,0:13:07.34,Default,,0,0,0,,If I'm right,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.52,0:13:09.38,Default,,0,0,0,,then the air inside of\Nthat can is on the brink
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.46,0:13:12.23,Default,,0,0,0,,of bursting from being\Npressurized in a vacuum!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.36,0:13:15.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Weather forecast!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.10,0:13:26.69,Default,,0,0,0,,He's been pushed back\Ninto the zero gravity.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.00,0:13:27.96,Default,,0,0,0,,He's finished now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.04,0:13:28.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Done for.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.32,0:13:31.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Your pathetic friend probably can't obtain
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.94,0:13:34.71,Default,,0,0,0,,enough air power to stop\Nthat momentum anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.96,0:13:37.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no! Weather forecast!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.10,0:13:39.26,Default,,0,0,0,,It's simply no use.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.88,0:13:42.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Cloud suit itself is about to break.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.10,0:13:51.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolene!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.01,0:13:53.19,Default,,0,0,0,,What the heck are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.28,0:13:54.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Go back!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.38,0:13:55.60,Default,,0,0,0,,He's going to shoot you!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.68,0:13:59.33,Default,,0,0,0,,On top of that, you'll lose\Noxygen just from the moving force!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.52,0:14:01.64,Default,,0,0,0,,She makes decisions so quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.36,0:14:06.01,Default,,0,0,0,,You're trying to stop the Cloud\NGuy's movement with your body,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.40,0:14:09.99,Default,,0,0,0,,and thus push him out, away from\Nthe zero-gravity zone again.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.98,0:14:16.40,Default,,0,0,0,,And yet, you won't be able to\Nget away from me like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.48,0:14:20.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm already well aware.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.54,0:14:22.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Your stand's extremely powerful.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.00,0:14:25.96,Default,,0,0,0,,The high speed of my\Nrotation bullets would
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.04,0:14:28.86,Default,,0,0,0,,easily be flicked away\Nas you defended yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.48,0:14:31.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I prepared this for that reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.82,0:14:33.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I looked all over for them everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.78,0:14:35.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I captured them and hid them away.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.16,0:14:40.50,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a lot of them. Rodents!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.66,0:14:41.72,Default,,0,0,0,,And they're alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.92,0:14:43.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Could it possibly be?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.68,0:14:44.60,Default,,0,0,0,,This is...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.68,0:14:45.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Stone Ocean!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.36,0:14:48.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Flick those dirty rodents away from us!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.16,0:14:52.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't see!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.30,0:14:54.40,Default,,0,0,0,,There we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.66,0:14:58.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't think you'd be able to push\Nthrough my zero-gravity power this much.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.84,0:15:00.64,Default,,0,0,0,,But you're defenseless now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.24,0:15:02.07,Default,,0,0,0,,It's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.15,0:15:03.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Final blow, Jolene Kujo.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.20,0:15:08.98,Default,,0,0,0,,With this, my mission\Nis officially complete.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.64,0:15:18.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Jumpin' Jack Spark is the\Nbest stand in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.92,0:15:21.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think I could\Never lose to anybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.48,0:15:23.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm glad to have gotten into this prison.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.96,0:15:26.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I've obtained enormous power here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.40,0:15:29.11,Default,,0,0,0,,There may be nothing I\Ncan't do in this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.36,0:15:32.06,Default,,0,0,0,,My future's the color\Nof an invincible rose.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.32,0:15:34.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna hand over the disc to Palesnake.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.28,0:15:38.04,Default,,0,0,0,,And then defeat him too\Nif I deem it necessary.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.12,0:15:40.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll do it with my own hands
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.70,0:15:47.70,Default,,0,0,0,,oh
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.74,0:15:58.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew it I
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.28,0:16:01.36,Default,,0,0,0,,was so certain you would\Ndo it how predictable
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.44,0:16:07.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I was just waiting for you to reload while\Nyou were reloading your Screw bullets,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.66,0:16:10.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I was biding my time\Nwith my threads flying.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.12,0:16:12.48,Default,,0,0,0,,And then you foolishly shot those at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.38,0:16:14.21,Default,,0,0,0,,This thread?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.72,0:16:16.19,Default,,0,0,0,,When in the hell did you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.00,0:16:18.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't ocean!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.72,0:16:36.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like you were the one who got\Ncompletely affected by the vacuum.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.76,0:16:37.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Also,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.67,0:16:39.85,Default,,0,0,0,,since you don't have a\Ncloud suit of your own,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.94,0:16:43.35,Default,,0,0,0,,your blood will boil up and\Nexplode faster than ours will.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.52,0:16:46.62,Default,,0,0,0,,We've beaten you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.88,0:16:48.24,Default,,0,0,0,,If you don't want to die,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.32,0:16:51.97,Default,,0,0,0,,then you've got to desist the\NZero Gravity Effect immediately!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.12,0:17:01.90,Default,,0,0,0,,That crime I committed, which got me\Ninto this prison in the first place.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.98,0:17:04.16,Default,,0,0,0,,How many times did I stab that woman?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.50,0:17:06.56,Default,,0,0,0,,When I killed my college professor.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.68,0:17:10.42,Default,,0,0,0,,The prosecutor said I stabbed\Nthat lady precisely 69 times.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.14,0:17:13.32,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the same feeling as then.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.58,0:17:15.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel it again after so long.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.58,0:17:19.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't forgive her\Nfor looking down on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.90,0:17:20.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.16,0:17:25.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Add peroxide to manganese dioxide and a
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.08,0:17:27.90,Default,,0,0,0,,chemical reaction occurs\Nand oxygen is produced.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.28,0:17:32.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Exactly like the oxygen in this\Nbottle, it keeps on spewing outwards.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.56,0:17:35.16,Default,,0,0,0,,After such a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.24,0:17:37.04,Default,,0,0,0,,That feeling of wanting\Nto murder somebody.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.12,0:17:38.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Has come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.14,0:17:39.52,Default,,0,0,0,,You're dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.60,0:17:42.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll carve an epitaph into\Nthe flesh of your corpse.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.24,0:17:43.12,Default,,0,0,0,,With shards of glass.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.20,0:17:44.67,Default,,0,0,0,,And make it reek of piss.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.16,0:17:57.26,Default,,0,0,0,,With those fresh cuts on your body.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.34,0:17:59.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Your blood will explode before mine does.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.26,0:18:01.44,Default,,0,0,0,,This is how your life ends, Jolene Cujo.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.52,0:18:06.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I got sent to this prison for stabbing\Nsomeone and I'll kill you by carving you up.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.20,0:18:09.91,Default,,0,0,0,,So you burst then leave this\Nprison have you become invincible?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.56,0:18:19.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll give mine to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.18,0:18:23.32,Default,,0,0,0,,It should be enough to\Nget the disc back from him
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.70,0:18:27.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Julie it's enough, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.52,0:18:33.00,Default,,0,0,0,,What in the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.54,0:18:34.88,Default,,0,0,0,,This is bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.18,0:18:36.89,Default,,0,0,0,,My body is also at its limit.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.12,0:18:40.14,Default,,0,0,0,,If I release the zero\Ngravity, air will flow in.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.56,0:18:42.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I might get away if I use that airflow.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.32,0:18:46.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Releasing zero gravity!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.92,0:18:48.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Jump in Jack Spark!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.58,0:18:55.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Stark!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.50,0:19:03.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You should have just released\Nzero gravity from the star.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.76,0:19:07.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You could have escaped from my\Nwrath using the wind pressure.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.28,0:19:12.06,Default,,0,0,0,,If you'd released it while you still had\Ndistance between yourself and Stone Ocean.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.14,0:19:14.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Instead, because of your\Narrogance, you waited.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.12,0:19:17.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Now the air is blowing you back to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.38,0:19:31.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Average for life.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.78,0:19:38.72,Default,,0,0,0,,For life.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.40,0:19:45.46,Default,,0,0,0,,How long till speedwagon gets\Nhere? What's left? Minutes?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.04,0:19:46.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Seconds?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.88,0:19:52.34,Default,,0,0,0,,On the other side of that door\Nthere's a passageway alongside the
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.42,0:19:56.96,Default,,0,0,0,,right wall there are windows that\Nlook out to the courtyard there you'll
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.04,0:20:00.44,Default,,0,0,0,,be able to see a revolving door's\Ngate that's the gate to the
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.52,0:20:06.38,Default,,0,0,0,,courtyard during daytime hours the\Ngate is unlocked and it's free access
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.42,0:20:10.38,Default,,0,0,0,,but the problem is how\Nare we going to open
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.46,0:20:13.38,Default,,0,0,0,,this double door i'll\Nhave a guard open it up
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.12,0:20:16.24,Default,,0,0,0,,We have this guy's work permit card.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.32,0:20:19.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll trick him into opening it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.68,0:20:21.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.00,0:20:23.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Once they open this double door,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.72,0:20:25.14,Default,,0,0,0,,you're going to beat up any and all guards
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.22,0:20:27.06,Default,,0,0,0,,in your path and force your way out there,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.14,0:20:27.97,Default,,0,0,0,,right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.34,0:20:29.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Good plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.96,0:20:32.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Not only will you have the\Ncrime of attempting escape,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.98,0:20:35.86,Default,,0,0,0,,but you'll also be put in\Nisolation for half a year.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.94,0:20:39.53,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll be left in a small cell\Nwhere you can't even exercise.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.38,0:20:41.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.92,0:20:46.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to the courtyard and handing this\Ndisc over to the Speedwagon Foundation.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.22,0:20:51.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Right now, it's my life's\Ngoal and only objective.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.02,0:20:54.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Shh!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.62,0:21:01.02,Default,,0,0,0,,A guard is coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.58,0:21:02.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.74,0:21:04.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Go hide somewhere over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.74,0:21:06.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll go on by myself from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.28,0:21:08.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Your wound is horrible.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.26,0:21:13.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Also, they could lock the gate right\Naway, if they see your blood. I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.00,0:21:14.83,Default,,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.18,0:21:21.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Something wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.82,0:21:23.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you hitting the door?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.82,0:21:28.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.68,0:21:31.30,Default,,0,0,0,,He said, it's you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.34,0:21:33.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Wrangler, what's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.10,0:21:35.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you making noise?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.90,0:21:37.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on, I'll open the door now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.32,0:21:48.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, if you're heading back to\Nthe men's prison, Lang Wrangler,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.36,0:21:50.70,Default,,0,0,0,,let's both visit the place of worship.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.54,0:21:53.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd like to speak with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.52,0:21:55.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.43,0:21:56.48,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not a guard?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.96,0:22:07.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Who is this guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.58,0:22:10.18,Default,,0,0,0,,This man isn't a guard or a prisoner.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.50,0:22:13.10,Default,,0,0,0,,This person's a tire.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.80,0:22:15.58,Default,,0,0,0,,It's like he's a...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.58,0:22:43.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Of some place other than here?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.58,0:22:50.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Although you think I smile!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.58,0:22:55.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Inside and all the while
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.58,0:23:03.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm wondering about my destiny.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.96,0:23:07.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm thinking
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.96,0:23:13.56,Default,,0,0,0,,about all the
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.64,0:23:18.42,Default,,0,0,0,,things I'd like
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.50,0:23:24.44,Default,,0,0,0,,to do in my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.94,0:23:29.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a dreamer.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.44,0:23:34.42,Default,,0,0,0,,A distant dreamer.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.32,0:23:39.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Dreaming far away.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.72,0:23:44.52,Default,,0,0,0,,From today!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.56,0:23:58.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.84,0:24:33.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
